<title>USA: ViroPharma cuts IPO price range.</title>
<headline>ViroPharma cuts IPO price range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ViroPharma Inc has cut the estimated range for shares in its initial public offering, according to regulatory documents.</p>
<p>The range is now $8 to $9 a share. Previously, it had been $11 to $13 a share.</p>
<p>Cowen is the lead underwriter of the offering. The Malvern, Pennsylvania company has proposed to trade on the Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;VPHM&quot;.</p>
</text>
